<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='utf-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1' />
    <title>ZeroTrace — Roulette Probability &amp; Risk Lab</title>
    <link rel='stylesheet' href='/stylesheets/style.css' />
    <script defer src='/vendor/spin-wheel/5.0.2/spin-wheel-iife.js'></script>
    <script defer src='/javascripts/roulette-ui.js'></script>
  </head>
  <body class='lab-page'>
    <dialog id='welcome-dialog' class='welcome-dialog' aria-labelledby='welcome-heading' aria-describedby='welcome-purpose welcome-credits welcome-risk'>
      <h2 id='welcome-heading'>Welcome to ZeroTrace</h2>
      <p id='welcome-purpose'>ZeroTrace is an educational European roulette simulator designed to demonstrate probability, expected returns and the risks of repeated betting.</p>
      <p id='welcome-credits'>All bets use virtual credits. No real money, deposits or withdrawals are involved.</p>
      <p id='welcome-risk'>Roulette outcomes are independent. Past results do not predict future spins, and no strategy guarantees a profit.</p>
      <button id='enter-simulator' class='spin-button entry-button' type='button'>Enter Simulator</button>
    </dialog>
    <main id='simulator' class='lab' inert>
      <header class='lab-header'>
        <p class='brand'>ZeroTrace</p>
        <h1>Roulette Probability &amp; Risk Lab</h1>
        <p>European single-zero roulette &middot; Virtual credits only &middot; No real money</p>
      </header>

      <div class='play-layout'>
        <section class='wheel-panel' aria-label='European roulette wheel'>
          <div class='wheel-shell'>
            <div id='roulette-wheel' class='wheel-canvas'></div>
            <div class='wheel-hub' aria-hidden='true'><span class='wheel-spindle'></span></div>
            <div id='ball-orbit' class='ball-orbit' aria-hidden='true'>
              <span id='roulette-ball' class='roulette-ball'></span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class='wheel-caption'>37 pockets: 18 red, 18 black and one green zero.</p>
          <p id='motion-note' class='motion-note'>Ball rests on the outer rail before a spin.</p>
        </section>

        <section class='betting-panel' aria-labelledby='betting-heading'>
          <h2 id='betting-heading'>Place your bet</h2>
          <p id='table-help'>Numbers are for reference. Only Red and Black can be selected.</p>
          <div class='number-table-scroll' role='region' aria-label='European number layout' aria-describedby='table-help' tabindex='0'>
            <table class='number-layout'>
              <caption>0–36 · Scroll the table on narrow screens</caption>
              <tbody>
                <% [3, 2, 1].forEach(function(rowStart, rowIndex) { %>
                  <tr>
                    <% if (rowIndex === 0) { %>
                      <td rowspan='3' data-table-number='0'>0</td>
                    <% } %>
                    <% for (var number = rowStart; number <= 36; number += 3) { %>
                      <td data-table-number='<%= number %>'><%= number %></td>
                    <% } %>
                  </tr>
                <% }); %>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <form id='betting-form' aria-describedby='table-help stake-help'>
            <fieldset class='bet-options'>
              <legend>Bet on a color</legend>
              <label class='bet-option bet-option-red' for='bet-red'>
                <input id='bet-red' type='radio' name='selectedBet' value='red' checked required />
                <span>Red</span>
              </label>
              <label class='bet-option bet-option-black' for='bet-black'>
                <input id='bet-black' type='radio' name='selectedBet' value='black' />
                <span>Black</span>
              </label>
            </fieldset>
            <div class='stake-controls'>
              <div class='stake-presets'>
                <p id='stake-presets-label'>Quick stakes (credits)</p>
                <div class='stake-chips' role='group' aria-labelledby='stake-presets-label'>
                  <button class='stake-chip' type='button' data-stake-credits='10' aria-label='Stake 10 virtual credits' aria-pressed='false' disabled>10</button>
                  <button class='stake-chip' type='button' data-stake-credits='50' aria-label='Stake 50 virtual credits' aria-pressed='false' disabled>50</button>
                  <button class='stake-chip' type='button' data-stake-credits='100' aria-label='Stake 100 virtual credits' aria-pressed='false' disabled>100</button>
                  <button class='stake-chip' type='button' data-stake-credits='500' aria-label='Stake 500 virtual credits' aria-pressed='false' disabled>500</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class='stake-row'>
                <div class='stake-field'>
                  <label class='stake-label' for='stake-credits'>Custom stake</label>
                  <input id='stake-credits' name='stakeCredits' type='number' min='1' max='1000' step='1' value='1' required inputmode='numeric' aria-describedby='stake-help stake-error' />
                </div>
                <button id='spin-button' class='spin-button' type='submit' disabled>Spin</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p id='stake-help' class='control-note'>1–1000 virtual credits, whole numbers only.</p>
            <p id='stake-error' class='stake-error' aria-live='polite'></p>
            <p class='bet-summary'><output id='bet-summary' for='bet-red bet-black stake-credits' aria-live='polite'>Selected bet: Red. Stake: 1 virtual credit.</output></p>
            <p id='spin-status' class='game-status' role='status' aria-live='polite'>Loading controls.</p>
          </form>

          <noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to play and load saved history.</p></noscript>
        </section>
      </div>

      <section class='result-section' aria-labelledby='result-heading'>
        <h2 id='result-heading'>Latest spin result</h2>
        <p id='result-empty'>No completed spin in this session.</p>
        <dl id='result-details' class='result-details' hidden>
          <div><dt>Result number / color</dt><dd id='result-number'></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Net payout</dt><dd id='result-net'></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Win / loss</dt><dd id='result-outcome'></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Bet / stake</dt><dd id='result-bet'></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Expected net return per spin</dt><dd id='result-expected'></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Win / loss probabilities</dt><dd id='result-probabilities'></dd></div>
        </dl>
        <details id='result-record' class='record-details' hidden>
          <summary>Saved record details</summary>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>Experiment ID</dt><dd id='result-id'></dd></div>
            <div><dt>Saved at (UTC)</dt><dd id='result-time'></dd></div>
          </dl>
        </details>
      </section>

      <section class='education-section' aria-labelledby='education-heading'>
        <h2 id='education-heading'>How Red &amp; Black Works</h2>
        <p class='education-brief'>Choose Red or Black before spinning. The wheel has 37 numbers: 18 red, 18 black, and one green zero. You win when the ball lands on your chosen color. Zero makes both color bets lose.</p>
        <p class='education-brief'>Each color has an 18-in-37 chance of winning (48.65%). Over many spins, the average expected loss is about 2.70 credits for every 100 credits staked. This does not predict your next spin.</p>
        <details class='learn-odds'>
          <summary>Learn the Odds</summary>
          <div class='education-layout'>
            <div>
              <p>A European wheel has 37 equally likely pockets: 18 red, 18 black and one green zero. Red or Black wins with probability <strong>18/37 (48.65%)</strong> and loses with probability <strong>19/37 (51.35%)</strong>. Zero is a loss for either color.</p>
              <p><strong>Net payout</strong> is your profit or loss, excluding any returned stake. A 10-credit Red/Black bet wins 10 credits net (20 returned in total), or loses the full 10-credit stake.</p>
              <p><strong>Expected net return per spin:</strong> (18/37 &times; stake) &minus; (19/37 &times; stake) = <strong>&minus;stake/37</strong>.</p>
              <p>The <strong>2.70% house edge</strong> means an average loss of about 2.70 credits per 100 credits staked over many spins. It does not predict a single spin. Past results do not change the next spin's odds.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class='reference-scroll' role='region' aria-label='Informational betting comparison' tabindex='0'>
                <table class='reference-table'>
                  <caption>Bet comparison &mdash; information only</caption>
                  <thead><tr><th scope='col'>Bet (coverage)</th><th scope='col'>Win probability</th><th scope='col'>Net win</th><th scope='col'>House edge</th></tr></thead>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr><th scope='row'>Red/Black (18 numbers)</th><td>18/37 (48.65%)</td><td>+stake (1:1)</td><td>2.70%</td></tr>
                    <tr><th scope='row'>Dozen (12 numbers)</th><td>12/37 (32.43%)</td><td>+2 &times; stake (2:1)</td><td>2.70%</td></tr>
                    <tr><th scope='row'>Straight-up (1 number)</th><td>1/37 (2.70%)</td><td>+35 &times; stake (35:1)</td><td>2.70%</td></tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
              <p class='control-note'>A dozen covers 1&ndash;12, 13&ndash;24 or 25&ndash;36; straight-up covers one chosen number from 0&ndash;36. Dozen and Straight-up are reference material only and cannot be selected here.</p>
              <p class='control-note'>These are standard single-zero payouts. A losing bet costs the full stake; each listed bet has expected net return &minus;stake/37. Larger winning payouts do not remove the house edge.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
      </section>

      <section class='history-section' aria-labelledby='history-heading'>
        <div class='history-heading'>
          <h2 id='history-heading'>Recent saved experiments</h2>
          <button id='history-refresh' class='history-refresh' type='button' disabled>Refresh history</button>
        </div>
        <p id='history-status' class='game-status' role='status' aria-live='polite'>Loading saved history.</p>
        <div id='history-scroll' class='history-scroll' role='region' aria-label='Saved experiment history' tabindex='0' hidden>
          <table class='history-table'>
            <caption>Latest 20 experiments, newest first</caption>
            <thead>
              <tr><th scope='col'>Bet</th><th scope='col'>Stake</th><th scope='col'>Result</th><th scope='col'>Outcome</th><th scope='col'>Net credits</th><th scope='col'>Record</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id='history-body'></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <button id='history-toggle' class='history-toggle' type='button' aria-controls='history-body' aria-expanded='false' hidden disabled>Show more</button>
      </section>

      <footer class='lab-footer'>
        Wheel animation: <a href='https://github.com/CrazyTim/spin-wheel'>spin-wheel 5.0.2</a>.
        <a href='/vendor/spin-wheel/5.0.2/LICENSE.txt'>MIT license</a>.
        <a href='/vendor/spin-wheel/5.0.2/SOURCE.txt'>Source and checksum</a>.
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
